# ---- Thesis documents — NOT published to GitHub ----------------------------
# The repo publishes CODE. The reasoning behind the code is unpublished thesis
# work and stays local until submission.
#
#   REFERENCES.md               every design decision -> paper -> quotation
#   KGLLM_INHERITED_VS_ADDED.md what is inherited vs what is the contribution
#   STATUS.md                   internal build state, audit log, open items
#   DEPLOY.md                   Kaggle run instructions
#
# ⚠️ ALL FOUR STILL EXIST ON DISK. They are untracked, not deleted — and so
#    they are NOT BACKED UP by this repo. Copy them somewhere else.
REFERENCES.md
KGLLM_INHERITED_VS_ADDED.md
STATUS.md
DEPLOY.md

# ---- The paper — NOT published to GitHub -----------------------------------
# The manuscript, figure and bibliography stay local. The repo publishes the
# CODE only; the write-up is unpublished work and stays off a public remote
# until it is submitted.
#
# ⚠️ The files still exist on disk in paper/ — they are simply untracked.
